00:11:19,920 --> 00:11:26,040
highest-ranking SS doctor ever to face trial in a German court.

116
00:11:26,040 --> 00:11:32,360
The trial against Horst Fischer began in March 1966 before the Supreme Court of  

117
00:11:32,360 --> 00:11:36,680
East Germany. Fischer was accused of carrying out selections,  

118
00:11:36,680 --> 00:11:41,440
supervise gas chamber murders and manage the procurement of Zyklon B for  

